      "evidence_char_start": 9661,
      "evidence_char_end": 9955,
      "evidence_text": "Take levothyroxine tablets and capsules on an empty stomach, at least 30 to 60 minutes before breakfast with a full glass of water. A full glass of water is important to avoid choking or gagging, because the tablet can start to break apart quickly. Take the medicine at the same time each day.\n",
